  "solution": "Concept used:\n\nFollow the BODMAS rule as given in the below table:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/1a057cc6d6b8e0895a55add7f4d97e07109a6601a719772fca9f5e02d4ab95e4.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n(5 frac{1)/(3) div 2 (1)/(4) × (9)/(4) div (1)/(4) { of } 7 (1)/(2)}{((8)/(3) { of } 1 (1)/(15)) div 5}\n\n⇒ (frac{16)/(3) div (9)/(4) × (9)/(4) div (1)/(4) { of } (15)/(2)}{((8)/(3) { of } (16)/(15)) div 5}\n\n⇒ (frac{16)/(3) div (9)/(4) × (9)/(4) div ((1)/(4) times (15)/(2))}{((8)/(3) { of } (16)/(15)) times ((1)/(5))}\n\n⇒ (frac{16)/(3) times (4)/(9) × (9)/(4) times (8)/(15)}{(8)/(3) times (16)/(15) times(1)/(5)}\n\n⇒ (frac{16)/(3) times (8)/(15)}{(8)/(3) times (16)/(15) times(1)/(5)}\n\n⇒ (1)/(frac{1){5}}\n\n⇒ 5\n\n**The answer is 5.**\n\n1e",
